OL,3,GNEWSADriver sentenced over crash that
OL,4,Akilled 'soulmate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been sentenced for causing
OL,7,Fthe death of "the most selfless, loving
OL,8,Fand affectionate person" after swerving
OL,9,Fonto the wrong side of the road.
OL,11,FMichael Ramstedt, 58, died in the
OL,12,Ftwo-vehicle collision on the B4070 in
OL,13,FBirdlip, Gloucestershire, at about
OL,14,F05:30 BST on 2 July 2024.
OL,16,FNuno Gouveia, 32, of Chipping Street in
OL,17,FTetbury, initially gave differing
OL,18,Faccounts of what happened, but
OL,19,Fultimately pleaded guilty to causing
OL,20,Fdeath by careless driving.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
