OL,3,GNEWSADriver sentenced over crash that
OL,4,Akilled 'soulmate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was sentenced at Cheltenham
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday to
OL,8,Feight months imprisonment, suspended
OL,9,Ffor 12 months, and issued with a
OL,10,Fone-year driving ban.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
